title: The World Congress
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_congress_timer <= 0 and comintern_member = 1 and ((year = 1920 and month >= 5 and month <= 7) or (year = 1921 and month >= 4 and month <= 6) or (year = 1922 and month >= 9 and month <= 11))
on-arrival: c_congress_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 400
is-card: true
tags: international

= The World Congress

[? if year = 1920 : The Second World Congress of the Communist International meets this summer in Petrograd and Moscow, while the Red Army marches on Warsaw. It will lay down the conditions for joining. ?][? if year = 1921 : The Third World Congress meets in Moscow in June. Lenin and Trotsky want to talk about winning the majority of the working class. Zinoviev and Bukharin want to talk about the offensive. ?][? if year = 1922 : The Fourth World Congress meets in Moscow this autumn. Lenin is ill, and may speak only once. ?]

Whoever goes will speak for the German party before the whole International.

- @loyal: Send a delegation loyal to the Zentrale.
- @every: Send every current.
- @executive: Let the Executive invite whom it wants.
- @easy_discard

@loyal
subtitle: One voice for the party. Lenin respects a section that knows its own mind; Zinoviev does not.
on-arrival: {!
Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] += 6;
Q.independence += 3;
RG.ecci('lenin', 5);
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -5);
!}

Our delegates speak with one voice in Moscow, and the Executive takes the measure of the German leadership.

@every
subtitle: The party feels heard. Radek enjoys the arguments.
on-arrival: {!
Q.unity += 4;
RG.ecci('radek', 8);
Q.independence -= 2;
!}

The German delegation argues with itself in the corridors of the Kremlin. The Russians listen to everyone and decide for themselves.

@executive
subtitle: [? if lock_moscow_orders = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Zinoviev is delighted, and invites the current he prefers, the [+ moscow_backs_name +].
choose-if: lock_moscow_orders < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids taking orders from Moscow.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.lock_moscow_orders == 1) {
    Q.unity -= 10;
    Q[Q.leading_faction + '_satisfaction'] -= 10;
}
RG.ecci('zinoviev', 12);
Q.independence -= 6;
if (Q.moscow_backs && Q['lean_' + Q.moscow_backs] !== undefined) {
    Q['lean_' + Q.moscow_backs] += 2;
    Q[Q.moscow_backs + '_satisfaction'] += 6;
}
!}

The Executive invites the comrades it finds most promising. Several of them are not on speaking terms with the Zentrale.
